  "input": "When is the deploy freeze for the ledger, and why?\n[2026-03-13] standup/boreal/2026-03-13: Deploy freeze for the ledger: 2026-03-30 to 2026-04-03 (the fiscal year close). [2025-09-26] standup/atlas/2025-09-26: For newcomers: the deploy window for the ledger service is still on Wednesdays between 09:00 and 11:00 UTC. [2025-11-11] standup/atlas/2025-11-11: Deploy freeze for billing-api: 2025-11-24 to 2025-12-02 (the peak season). Observation from the Atlas team: after Tuesday's deploy, search-indexer's p99 latency doubled.",
